        <activityName xml:lang="en">Metallization paste, back side, aluminium, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Metallization paste, back side, aluminium, at plant
Chemical composition of typical pastes taken from Material Safety Data Sheets. Energy use and infrastructure estimated with data for solder production.;
UUID: 3e097e0d-157a-3752-9b5d-57f06fa55a54
Production of paste used in production of photovoltaic cells.
Location: Dat of production in Europe.
Technology: Assumption that production technology is similar as for solders.
Time period: Data investigated in 2006.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Chemical composition of typical pastes taken from Material Safety Data Sheets. 
Extrapolations: Other data investigated with information from solder production.
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_3e097e0d-157a-3752-9b5d-57f06fa55a54.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
